t","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>Workshop</h1><p>Create and upload new Workshop assets to add new buildings, decoration, and dinosaurs to Parkasaurus. Spice up your dino best friend adventures. Click the link to learn more!</p><br><h1>Community</h1><p>Be sure to join our Discord: discord[dot]com/invite/washbear<br><br>Or find the link or our Discord and Newsletter at our website: washbearstudio[dot]com<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/591460/extras/b2c84d054cead52af6dcef978c710ab9.poster.avif?t=1767726016\" width=600 height=142 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/591460/extras/b2c84d054cead52af6dcef978c710ab9.webm?t=1767726016\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/591460/extras/b2c84d054cead52af6dcef978c710ab9.mp4?t=1767726016\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/591460/extras/fc6d81a91c3bac843e4ecc9b6214e9dc.avif?t=1767726016\" width=600 height=104 /></span></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/591460/extras/35e1a6a157260996ee8ddf07787fe2b7.poster.avif?t=1767726016\" width=600 height=246 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/591460/extras/35e1a6a157260996ee8ddf07787fe2b7.webm?t=1767726016\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/591460/extras/35e1a6a157260996ee8ddf07787fe2b7.mp4?t=1767726016\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/591460/extras/7f80c5849cfa5c111992fc13b80532e8.avif?t=1767726016\" width=616 height=144 /></span><br>Parkasaurus is a dinosaur tycoon management simulation where you take care of your dinosaurs by constructing well-designed exhibits, researching specialized technologies, and maximizing profits to expand into the ultimate dinosaur theme park. Do you favor development that favors your dinosaurs or the guests?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/591460/extras/0bba31176e97043b43ccd0ebcff833cc.poster.avif?t=1767726016\" width=600 height=246 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/591460/extras/0bba31176e97043b43ccd0ebcff833cc.webm?t=1767726016\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/591460/extras/0bba31176e97043b43ccd0ebcff833cc.mp4?t=1767726016\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/591460/extras/295e40d3dbc76f31fd13296569d4221d.avif?t=1767726016\" width=616 height=144 /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXHIBIT DESIGN</h2> Design success - each dinosaur requires a unique biosphere, which means the shape of exhibit, materials used, ecology, plants, elevation and humidity all play a key role in the success of your Dinos.Unique privacy and biome systems that promote creative design.</ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PARK MANAGEMENT</h2> Spend resources wisely to build the ultimate Dino Park with over 80 buildable items and 4 employee types.</ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DINO BABIES</h2> Nurture and raise Dinos from a small egg all the way to their full adult size, with over 24 dinosaurs to discover in the base game and many more yet to be added.</ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >RETURN HOME CAMPAIGN</h2>Travel the globe encountering missions that challenge you to be the best dinosaur tycoon while helping your dinosaurs friends fulfill their destiny.</ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GUEST MONETIZATION</h2> A dynamic review system where each guest leaves a starred review based on their experience.</ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EMPLOYEE MANAGEMENT</h2> Level up rookie employees, or bring on established veterans, to help run your park smoothly and efficiently.</ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CHAOTIC DINO ESCAPES</h2> Keep a careful eye on your exhibits as Dinos try to make destructive escapes and attack your guests.</ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/591460/extras/f9a249b647692ba7cb00fadea52deb36.poster.avif?t=1767726016\" width=600 height=246 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/591460/extras/f9a249b647692ba7cb00fadea52deb36.webm?t=1767726016\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/591460/extras/f9a249b647692ba7cb00fadea52deb36.mp4?t=1767726016\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/591460/extras/16c487f538f2c984858e4053cf4fa24b.avif?t=1767726016\" width=616 height=144 /></span><br>There are only two of us working on this project and could really use your help. Here\u2019s how:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Tweet about us, to us, ask your favorite streamer to cover us or join our discord</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Tell your friends and family to support us</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Visit your local <strong>MUSEUM</strong>, or <strong>ZOO</strong>, or <strong>ANIMAL SHELTER</strong></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >And If You Read This Far, Thanks, We Love You!</h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/591460/extras/fec18690c145678b3369185e8c7099d1.poster.avif?t=1767726016\" width=600 height=246 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/591460/extras/fec18690c145678b3369185e8c7099d1.webm?t=1767726016\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/591460/extras/fec18690c145678b3369185e8c7099d1.mp4?t=1767726016\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>","developers":["Washbear Studio"],"dlc":[1931130,2388590,2435170],"genres":[{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/591460/header.jpg?t=1767726016","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2017 Washbear Studio Inc. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"metacritic":{"score":70,"url":"https://www.metacritic.com/game/pc/parkasaurus?ftag=MCD-06-10aaa1f"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/591460/300988/f3f6f98dde9d0720b76282b7476e2f1b89c6809a/1750557642/dash_av1.mpd?t=1595957323","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/591460/300988/f3f6f98dde9d0720b76282b7476e2f1b89c6809a/1750557642/dash_h264.mpd?t=1595957323","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/591460/300988/f3f6f98dde9d0720b76282b7476e2f1b89c6809a/1750557642/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1595957323","id":256794264,"name":"Parkasaurus Leaving Early Access","thumbnail"